--
N5008 [temp.spec]/4: each specialization of a member function template is
a distinct entity, whether or not it is defined.  Declaration-only member
templates (libstdc++'s SFINAE probes _S_test<F, A...>, used only inside
decltype) with the same parameter signature collapsed onto one unsuffixed
symbol, so every later specialization reported the FIRST one's return
type.  Three shapes: pack + decltype, decltype only, pack only.
